      'Wear loose clothing that allows easy access to the placement, and bring water and a snack. Allow yourself an unhurried morning: this is the culmination of a long process and deserves a calm arrival.',
      'If you are travelling for your session, arrive the night before. A flight or a long drive on the same morning leaves you tired, dehydrated and pressed for time, exactly the state you do not want to be in. Sleep in the city, wake without a clock, and come to the studio rested.',
